Third-party data
----------------
The software fetches figures from outside sources at run time. Those figures are
not covered by this project's licences; each source's own terms apply. What each
source allows, and the credit it asks for, is listed in docs/DATA_LICENCES.md and
shown in the app under Menu > About & data licences.

